{"authoredAt":"2026-08-14T08:40:51.180Z","conclusion":"findings","findings":[{"category":"adversarial","desc":"quality-provider-stdin-epipe: packages/main/src/core/host-run.ts:1325-1329 handles only synchronous child.stdin.end throws and installs no error listener on child.stdin. A provider that exits before consuming a large stdin prompt reproducibly terminates the supervisor with an unhandled write EPIPE, bypassing HostRunResult cleanup and terminal classification and leaving ManagedHostRun to converge only on a later touch or deadline.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/core/host-run.ts"],"severity":"high"},{"category":"adversarial","desc":"quality-cross-host-receipt-output-gap: packages/main/src/core/managed-host-run.ts:850-865 seals spec, result, events, and proposal but omits live-output.jsonl, while packages/main/src/handlers/cross-host-review.ts:694-726 reconstructs the host-B verdict from that unsealed file after terminal and records the unchanged receiptId. A temp-run reproduction appended a forged sequence-999 stdout frame after terminal; managedHostRunReceipt stayed byte-identical while readManagedHostRunOutput returned both original and forged verdict text. Post-terminal corruption can therefore change the consumed host-B decision without invalidating its claimed receipt provenance.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/core/managed-host-run.ts","packages/main/src/handlers/cross-host-review.ts"],"severity":"high"},{"category":"adversarial","desc":"quality-managed-import-lost-update: packages/main/src/handlers/managed-review-evidence.ts:137 serializes by receiptId, but lines 205-246 and 249-292 allocate IDs and rewrite story-wide review-passes and findings files. Two different managed receipts acquire different locks, can read the same pre-state, mint the same next ID, and last-writer-wins away the other reviewer's formal evidence. Parallel imports need the shared per-story review-pass and finding locks; the current same-receipt race coverage does not protect this cross-receipt case.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/handlers/managed-review-evidence.ts"],"severity":"high"}],"lane":"lattice-review-quality","providerAgent":"lattice-review-quality","readLog":{"digest":"03aaae1dcca58e06846151fbc4e34024f4524c7a6fedcd653f5b25d4b57043ef","filesReadFully":["docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-codex-command-boundary-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/managed-cross-provider-cli-execution.md","docs/requirements/decisions/review-assurance-floor-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/review-run-binding-race.md","docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md","docs/requirements/decisions/tier-c-crosshost-quorum-execution-plan.md"],"filesTriagedByName":["docs/requirements/decisions/cli-engine-english-open-source-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-authority-live-integration.md","docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-llm-usage-ledger-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/lattice-midflight-story-repair-and-gitroot-worktree-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/multi-host-keyword-candidate-spec-routing-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proof-admissibility-hardening-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proof-or-stop-agent-prompt-consolidation-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proof-or-stop-thin-entrypoint-contract-migration-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proofstory-acceptance-topology-and-pre-review-gates-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/proofstory-intent-collision-execution-plan.md","docs/requirements/decisions/workflow-convergence-failure-remediation-execution-plan.md"],"summary":{"readCount":6,"tokenCount":null}},"readManifest":{"candidateSpecSetDigest":"2e238f39d5e15e10b8ff41c46712df1b8f511ab7cb6ca92e80646014af3ad8ae","corpusDigest":"3ffd92bd03a28537625b2567c201f6a45109dcacea8d05035d982bbaa3c02b4b","filesReadFully":[".lattice/story